          "domain": "Craft and Structure",
          "focus": "Select the most logical and precise word or phrase to complete the context",
          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 · Topic 12 · Q16",
          "passageTitle": "Words in Context - Gap Filling — Q16",
          "passage": "Though many ______________ studies\nof the effect of altitude on blood chemistry focus\non people who live above sea level, researchers\nSuleiman A. Al Sweedan and Moath Alhaj\nrecently chose the novel path of focusing on\npeople who live below sea level, in locations such\nas the California towns of Salton City and\nCoachella.",
