          "domain": "Craft and Structure",
          "focus": "Select the most logical and precise word or phrase to complete the context",
          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 · Topic 12 · Q17",
          "passageTitle": "Words in Context - Gap Filling — Q17",
          "passage": "The Caves of Gargas paintings-stencils of human\nhands found in what is now France and dating\nfrom around 27,000 years ago-are thought of as\nart today, but the question of whether the\npeople of the time understood the paintings as\nsomething akin to art in one modern sense or in\nsome other way entirely is ____________:\nwe will never be able to answer it.",
