          "domain": "Craft and Structure",
          "focus": "Select the most logical and precise word or phrase to complete the context",
          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 · Topic 12 · Q18",
          "passageTitle": "Words in Context - Gap Filling — Q18",
          "passage": "The Gleaners, painted in the realist style by\nJean-François Millet, depicts peasants picking\nstray wheat from a field after the harvest. The\nrealists' emphasis on accurately portraying the\nexperiences of average working people was\nlargely a rejection of the romantic style evident\nin many paintings by Jérôme-Martin Langlois,\nwhich instead ______________ their\nsubjects' beauty or heroism while hiding all\nimperfection.",
