          "passage": "Alfred Nobel intended for the Nobel Prize to be\nan award honoring those who have contributed\n'the greatest benefit to mankind.' Indeed, the\nwork of Richard Laurence Millington Synge\nrepresented a significant\n______________ the field of chemistry,\nand in 1952 he was among those awarded the\nNobel Prize in Chemistry for 'their invention of\npartition chromatography.'",
