          "passageTitle": "Words in Context - Gap Filling — Q78",
          "passage": "The Roc-aux-Sorciers frieze–a group of relief\ncarvings of animals found in what is now France\nand dating from around 14,000 years ago–is\nsometimes said to be emotionally powerful\ndespite its age, but in fact the frieze is\n__________ precisely because of its age. It\nis the link of shared humanity with the artist\nacross so many centuries that gives the\nRoc-aux-Sorciers frieze such resonance.",
