          "passage": "Although the clustering of information\ntechnology firms in Northern California is often\ncited as typical of industrial agglomeration,\nGiulia Faggio et al. use UK data to show that\nthe mix of factors driving the phenomenon is\n__________ across industries: while the\npotential for knowledge spillovers can prompt\nagglomeration, collocation among tube\nmanufacturers occurs for different reasons.",
