          "passage": "Some paleontologists thought that a sudden\nshift toward an arid climate on the Australian\ncontinent may have brought about the rapid\nextinction of several species of large kangaroos\naround 200,000 years ago. However, new\nevidence that the change in conditions occurred\nwell before those species went extinct is forcing\npaleontologists to __________ that\nhypothesis.",
