          "passage": "Some cities track pedestrian activity to map\ntheir sidewalks, but this method often\n__________ sidewalks few pedestrians use,\nresulting in incomplete maps. Maryam Hosseini\nand her team found that a computer program\ntrained to identify sidewalks in aerial images of\nBoston could also accurately identify sidewalks\nin aerial images of Philadelphia and even\ndistinguished between concrete and granite.",
