          "passage": "Despite stated claims of global relevance, much\nmajor research on income inequality performed\nin the 2010s suffered from a myopic focus on a\nfew countries in North America and Western\nEurope, partly due to limited data availability.\nResearchers would later ____________\nthis shortcoming after gaining new access to\nadministrative records located in nations in\nSouth America, such as Brazil, and Eastern\nEurope, such as Russia.",
