          "passage": "One popular theory of the origin of the Moon,\nthe 'big whack,' posits that a protoplanet called\nTheia collided with Earth, flinging debris into\norbit that eventually coalesced into the Moon.\nUntil recently, Theia was ____________,\nbut researcher Qian Yuan and colleagues now\nclaim to have identified pieces of the protoplanet\nin the lowermost section of Earth's mantle.",
