          "passageTitle": "Words in Context - Gap Filling — Q184",
          "passage": "Ancient Inca inhabiting the Andes Mountains\nused terraces, rows of flattened land with\nbuilt-in irrigation systems, to grow crops at\ndifferent altitudes. This method of farming\nproved to be highly ______________ ,\nas evidenced by the great number and variety of\ncrops grown at that time.",
