          "passageTitle": "Words in Context - Gap Filling — Q185",
          "passage": "Geomagnetic storms can disturb Earth's\nionosphere, causing the models underlying the\nGlobal Positioning System (GPS) to produce\ninaccurate calculations. This illustrates the\neffect that space weather events can have on the\n______________ of GPS and other\nsystems that are dependent on satellite\nnavigation.",
