          "passage": "Certain features are almost always included in\nthe designs of mosques, like the minaret (or\ntower), which is considered to be a\n______________ of mosque architecture.\nEven mosques that exhibit elements of multiple\narchitectural styles, such as the Shah Jahan\nMosque, which incorporates elements from the\nMughal, Safavid, and Timurid styles, will also\ninclude several of these standard features.",
