          "passage": "The fact that publications by University of\nMinnesota economist Ellen R. McGrattan, who\nstudies financial policy, are so frequently cited in\nother scholars' work ______________\nthe usefulness of her research for her\npeers—other economists clearly find her studies\nvaluable for their own scholarship.",
