          "passageTitle": "Words in Context - Gap Filling — Q199",
          "passage": "Cognitive science research has found that people\ntend to be biased against art when they think it\nwas generated by artificial intelligence (AI)\nsoftware. One hypothesis for the preference for\nhuman-created art is that people\n______________ the effort behind a\npiece of art: the more work they believe went\ninto a piece's creation, the more likely they are\nto appreciate it.",
